@page "/image"

<PageTitle>DRYL — Image</PageTitle>

<div class="col fade-in" style="gap: var(--sp-7);">

    <ComponentDocHeader Slug="image">
        A responsive image surface with smart defaults — lazy + async loading, an automatic
        aspect-ratio to kill layout shift, object-fit cover, a shimmer skeleton while loading
        and a stylised icon fallback on error. AI-native: with <code>Ai</code> set, the image
        area itself reacts — a faint accent wash, a drifting violet→cyan cloud while thinking,
        a blur-to-sharp <code>Streaming</code> reveal (drive it with <code>Progress</code>) and
        a scale-in once <code>Generated</code>.
    </ComponentDocHeader>

    <DemoExample Title="Ratios, fit &amp; rounding" Source="Image/Basics">
        <DRYL.Components.Demo.Components.Examples.Image.Basics />
    </DemoExample>

    <DemoExample Title="Error fallback" Source="Image/Fallback">
        <DRYL.Components.Demo.Components.Examples.Image.Fallback />
    </DemoExample>

    <DemoExample Title="AI states" Source="Image/AiStates">
        <DRYL.Components.Demo.Components.Examples.Image.AiStates />
    </DemoExample>

</div>
